- NEW OpenAPI doc declares **zero `securitySchemes` / global security** across all 37 paths — auth is middleware-only, not spec-declared.
- NEW Two-stage token check confirmed: no-header→"No access token provided", non-base64→"No base64 encoded…", bad-base64→"An invalid access token…" — opaque-base64 design reconfirmed.
