## STEP 1 — DELTA

- [NEW] `GET /v2/auth/token-info` — **unauthenticated token-introspection endpoint, never mapped in 33 cycles**. Reachable with zero credentials; documented 200 schema is `{active: bool, expiresAt: date-time, permissions: TokenUserPermissions}` (all three required). Two-tier 422 error oracle proven: no header / valid-base64 → `"invalid access token format"`; `Bearer !!!notbase64!!!` → `"access token not in base64 format"`. Byte-identical behavior on `beta-apis`.
- [NEW] `POST /v2/auth/api-key` — **third credential class, never mapped**. `APICredentials = {companyId, clientId, key}` (all required); "Authenticates via an API key and returns an access token"; 403 documents account-status gating. Entirely distinct from the 30-cycle password and guest-link records.
- [NEW] `POST /v2/auth/group-link` — **never mapped; the KB treats `/v2/auth/guest-link` as the only guest path**. Spec has a *separate* endpoint with `AuthenticateGroupLinkRequestBody = {accessKey, companyId, displayName?, externalId?, roomId}`, where `externalId` is documented as "used to derive a reproducible user ID to prevent simultaneous use" (minLength 32, maxLength 256). Reply `GroupLinkAuthenticationInfo` returns `participantId` and a `clientLaunchUrl` of the form `alfaview://apis.alfaview.com:443?companyId={}&roomId={}&token={}`.
- [NEW] `tools.alfaview.com/whiteboard/*` **resolved to a dead service registration** — see STEP 4. The `code:5` vs `code:12` differential is now proven: a *registered* path with a wrong verb returns `code:12 "Method Not Allowed"` (`/poll/pollservice/list`, both GET and OPTIONS, 501/55B), while `/whiteboard/**` returns `code:5 "Not Found"` for GET **and** OPTIONS across 20 candidate service names. Under grpc-gateway semantics `code:5` on a mounted handler means no method is registered.
- [NEW] OpenAPI declares **zero `securitySchemes` and zero per-operation `security` on all 37 paths**, while runtime enforcement demonstrably exists (`/v2/users/me` → 401). The spec documents no auth model at all.
- [CHANGED] `tools.alfaview.com` mount enumeration closed: only two mounted prefixes exist — `/poll/` (Go-native 19B 404 for the bare prefix, code 12 on the registered path) and `/whiteboard/` (code 5, empty). 18 further candidate product prefixes (`survey`, `feedback`, `annotation`, `recording`, `transcript`, `chat`, `breakout`, `qa`, `room`, `files`, `upload`, `screen`, `share`, `presentation`, `whiteboardsvc`, `whiteboard2`, …) all return the 615B SPA catch-all.
- NO_DELTA: OpenAPI MD5 `357b94d367909a40b9299b543d23712b` (127532B, 37 paths), JWKS 200/16257B (`3f8d456c`), OIDC 200/2169B, introspect OPTIONS 405, authorize 200/6176B, users/me 401/107B, graphql GET 400/406B, tools app-bundle 137343B md5 `b7f17c85ccd8d91e9b831a6bc2aa863c` (only `/poll/pollservice` service string, zero `whiteboard` refs). 33rd consecutive byte-stable cycle.

