stration/general/room-permissions/).\n\n### User permissions\n\nUser permissions are high level permissions applied to users independently from specific rooms.\nFor further information please refer to the [user permissions section in the support center](https://support.alfaview.com/en/administration/general/user-permissions/).\n",
