`[PARKED]` Mass assignment — **class closed this cycle.** All 21 request-body schemas are `additionalProperties: false`. No undeclared-property injection point exists on the REST surface. Not re-litigated.

`[PARKED]` 403-declaration asymmetry; two-tier 401 and the false base64 message; the pre-auth query-parameter binder as a standalone enumeration oracle; `roomTypes` doc defect; SSRF as a class; the `Participant`/`userShow` third-tier probe — all carried forward unchanged, all previously downgraded on stated closure conditions.

