  Folded in as supporting evidence; not raised as its own hypothesis.
[PARKED] /v2/audit-log/{id} detail route and the 4 metadata subpaths — 404/19B on all five. Closed, not
  carried.
[PARKED] Carried hypotheses 2 and 3 — no probe fired against them this cycle, so neither number moved.
  Recorded as unchanged rather than re-stated as fresh.

[FINAL] 1) apis.alfaview.com GET /v2/audit-log — live undocumented 39th path, schema-orphan-linked,
