## Important Details
- Final analysis must separate facts from hypotheses, avoid endpoint-map-only output, and use only traceable evidence.
- Live testing is passive-first, read-only, ≤1 rps, and limited to `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`; no mutations, auth bypass, or customer-data access.
- Out of scope: brute force/rate-limit policy, descriptive errors, public login panels, missing email verification, scanner-only claims, and similar rejected classes.
