   admin        boolean        If true, the associated user is an admin.
   chat         boolean        Permission to chat.
   join         boolean        Permission to join the room.
   promote      boolean        Permission to promote permissions for other users.
   screen       boolean        Permission to share the screen.
   upload       boolean        Permission to upload files.
   video        boolean        Permission to stream video input.
   vip          boolean        Permission to mark users as VIP.
   voice        boolean        Permission to speak.

=== TokenUserPermissions addProps=False required=['manageCompany', 'userAdmin', 'userList', 'userShow', 'roomAdmin', 'roomList', 'roomCreate']
   manageCompany    If true, the user can manage company settings.
   roomAdmin        If true, the user can create, update and delete any room.
   roomCreate       If true, the user can create rooms for their company.
   roomList         If true, the user can list all rooms in their company.
   userAdmin        If true, the user can create, update and delete other users, send password reset mails and resend sign-up mails for new users.
   userList         If true, the user can list all users in their company.
   userShow         If true, the user can see the user names of all users in rooms they can access.

