```
[RISK] alfaview gmbh: 63. Up 1 from 62. No unauthenticated exposure was found — every probe this
      cycle was auth-bound or method-layer only, and the one route I wanted to reason about
      (POST /v2/rooms) returned 401 with no Allow leakage before I touched a body. The increase
      reflects a new chain on a WRITE primitive reached through the lowest useful privilege bit
      (roomCreate), whose principal field cannot distinguish user, guest-link and group-link
      identifiers, and whose read side turns that ambiguity into a principal-type discriminator via
      a 200 response rather than an error tier. It outranks the standing guest-link chain on
      exploitability because it needs no foreign-tenant cooperation and no prior credential
      harvest — one self-owned low-privilege account answers it in three requests. Risk is carried
      from the published contract, not measured; the 94 introspect and 90 guest/group-link chains
      remain strictly token-gated, and the 45 quota differential is contingent on the absent prose
      reflecting absent enforcement.
```
