## Objective
- Continue the authorized alfaview gmbh bug-bounty investigation in `phase=POC`, `target=api`, prioritizing high-value authentication, IDOR/BOLA, OAuth, GraphQL, and business-logic flaws.
- Produce the required structured report for `bugs.olivermaicher.eu` without claiming unverified impact.

## Important Details
- Scope is limited to alfaview-owned infrastructure, applications, APIs, portals, support systems, websites, and domains; avoid rejected classes such as brute force/rate-limit policy, descriptive errors, scanners without manual POC, SSRF without a fetch primitive, clickjacking without exploit, and customer-data exposure.
- Passive reconnaissance must remain `≤1 rps`; unrestricted live probing is GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only. POSTs and writes require explicit authorization, self-owned data, and the planned approval boundary.
