## Objective
- Act as a senior bug bounty hunter ANALYST for the alfaview gmbh program (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu), running a 7-step analysis loop (delta → prioritize → hypotheses → self-critique → next action → learning → risk) over passive-first, read-only probing of in-scope alfaview assets.
