## Objective
- Run a structured 8-step bug bounty analysis cycle for the alfaview gmbh program (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu), producing only structured blocks: DELTA, PRIO, HYP, PARKED/FINAL, NEXT, LEARN, RISK.
- Deep-hunt high-value classes (broken auth, IDOR/BOLA, SSRF, mass assignment, JWT confusion, OAuth flaws, GraphQL) across in-scope alfaview assets, passive-first at ≤1 rps.

## Important Details
- State: `{"phase": "POC", "target": "api"}`; current priority order: (1) introspect bypass 92, (2) CreatePermissions BOLA 80, (3) 403 asymmetry 58.
- Live probe constraints: GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only, ≤1 rps, no mutating/auth-bypass tests on live customer data; POST tests require HUMAN-provided self-owned account/token.
- REJECTED classes list is extensive (brute-force, username enumeration, descriptive errors, clickjacking w/o exploit, TLS, mail config, etc.) — never re-propose.
- Key standing facts:
  - OpenAPI rotated 2026-10-06: md5 `284a3383…` (132100B) → `06231fadca0b36c314476322337976db` (174787B, 38 paths, 57 ops); first-ever `components.securitySchemes.accessToken` with `bearerFormat: opaque`; `security` on 53/57 ops (only 4 `/v2/auth/*` POSTs lack it); YAML now 228358B / `c65f6a50`. Snapshot stored at `recon-notes/alfaview-openapi-2026-10-06.json`.
  - SSO standing: OIDC md5 `f78a08fc`/2169B, JWKS `3f8d456c`/16257B (7×RS256, path `/.well-known/jwks.json`), introspect OPTIONS 405, `introspection_endpoint` absent from discovery while endpoint live; introspect client-auth bypass conditional on token shape (only JWT-shaped tokens get client check; opaque alfaview tokens take unchecked path).
  - apis standing: `/v2/users/me/company` 401/107B md5 `60ed2f29`; `/v2/audit-log` 422/232B (undocumented 39th path); graphql GET 400/406B (now `__typename` returns 200, was 400); tools poll list 501/55B; tools `/whiteboard/` 404/47B.
  - `client-diagnostics-ingest.alfaview.com` went NXDOMAIN 2026-10-06.
  - `app.alfaview.com/assets/app.min.67e8a68d…js` → 302 `/`; bundle served from `alfaview-com-assets.alfaview.com` (1092529B, md5 `2cb91283…`, contains `adminSwitchCompany`).
- Prior-cycle retractions to preserve: UUID path-param patterns claim FALSE (zero `uuid`/`pattern` in spec); `Permissions.admin` scope sentence misattributed (lives on `PermissionsEdit.admin`); accessKey existence oracle does not exist; query-binder oracle reproduces public spec only (rejected as standalone finding); 403-declaration asymmetry not behaviorally load-bearing (rejected as standalone); JWT alg-confusion closed at both apis and sso userinfo; logout open redirect closed; SSRF closed on REST; mass assignment closed (all 21 body schemas `additionalProperties:false`).
- Procedural rules in force: guessed URLs never become findings (recover canonical from `inventory/alfaview.md` / `leads/lead-bigpickle.md` verify_steps); contract text quoted only after per-field lookup; delta claims need a second method (DNS vs HTTP).

## Work State
### Completed
- Cycle 2026-10-06 19:05 output emitted: PRIO (introspect 92, CreatePermissions 80, 403 asymmetry 58); HYPs registered for all three; PARKED (token-info expired-token 45, device_authorize 44); NEXT = HUMAN request; LEARN/CHANGED/NO_DELTA/PROCEDURAL entries recorded.
- OpenAPI rotation fully characterized (declaration-depth only; no paths moved; `/v2/audit-log` still unpublished; per-op status sets unchanged → 403 asymmetry survives).
- Ranked hypotheses file shows top entry: introspect bypass (92, from `art/lead_bigpickle.txt`).

### Active
