### Blocked
- All three HIGH chains are AUTH_HELPED/HUMAN_ONLY: need one self-owned low-privilege alfaview account, one non-moderated room, and one opaque access token (plus an expired one for the parked token-info claim) from a human.
- Passive surface at a 40+ cycle byte-stable plateau; no new unauthenticated exploit surface found.

