## Objective
- Act as bug-bounty analyst for alfaview gmbh (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu) running the 8-step structured workflow (DELTA → PRIORITIZE → HYPOTHESES → SELF-CRITIQUE → NEXT ACTION → LEARNING → RISK) against in-scope alfaview infra.
